      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "話說，走散的粉蝶蛹一共是<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>12隻<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
